## Run locally

```bash
cp .env.example .env
npm install
npm run start:dev          # starts HTTP server on localhost:3000
```

## Deploy to AWS

```bash
npm install -g serverless
npm run build
sls deploy                 # deploys to AWS Lambda + API Gateway
```

